{
  "$comment": [
    "ONE fixture for the Resume-all count, consumed by BOTH suites:",
    "  - pytest  test/test_chat_resume_all.py  (collect_interrupted_idle, start_resume_all's total)",
    "  - vitest  website/src/test/ChatSidebar.resumeAll.test.tsx (interruptedIdleSlots, the row's count)",
    "",
    "The sidebar counts the sessions it offers to resume from the slots payload,",
    "in the browser. The server picks the sessions a press resumes from the slots",
    "themselves. The number on the button must be the run's total, so this file",
    "is the single artifact both are checked against: divergence on EITHER side",
    "fails here.",
    "",
    "Each slot lists the `facts` the pytest suite builds it from, and the `row`",
    "the slots payload carries for it: the fields the browser's count reads, or",
    "null for a slot the payload leaves out. The pytest suite checks every row",
    "against serialize_slots and `expected` against the server. The vitest suite",
    "hands the same rows to the chat page's surface filter and the sidebar, and",
    "checks `expected` against the count it renders.",
    "",
    "Facts: transcript (interrupted / start_failed / finished / empty), running",
    "(the slot's own turn task is live), reserved (a turn admission is held but",
    "no turn has started), linked_turn_running (a channel-path turn holds the",
    "linked session), subagents_running, under_construction, executor, mode.",
    "",
    "Add a slot here rather than a per-side test when a new fact can change",
    "whether a session counts."
  ],
  "cases": [
    {
      "name": "every fact the count reads",
      "slots": [
        {
          "key": "cut-short",
          "facts": {"transcript": "interrupted"},
          "row": {"mode": "", "surface": "", "running": false, "interrupted": true, "subagents_running": false, "executor": "local"}
        },
        {
          "key": "start-failed",
          "facts": {"transcript": "start_failed"},
          "row": {"mode": "", "surface": "", "running": false, "interrupted": true, "subagents_running": false, "executor": "local"}
        },
        {
          "key": "finished",
          "facts": {"transcript": "finished"},
          "row": {"mode": "", "surface": "", "running": false, "interrupted": false, "subagents_running": false, "executor": "local"}
        },
        {
          "key": "empty",
          "facts": {"transcript": "empty"},
          "row": {"mode": "", "surface": "", "running": false, "interrupted": false, "subagents_running": false, "executor": "local"}
        },
        {
          "key": "busy",
          "facts": {"transcript": "interrupted", "running": true},
          "row": {"mode": "", "surface": "", "running": true, "interrupted": false, "subagents_running": false, "executor": "local"}
        },
        {
          "key": "reserved",
          "facts": {"transcript": "interrupted", "reserved": true},
          "row": {"mode": "", "surface": "", "running": false, "interrupted": true, "subagents_running": false, "executor": "local"}
        },
        {
          "key": "channel-turn",
          "facts": {"transcript": "interrupted", "linked_turn_running": true},
          "row": {"mode": "", "surface": "", "running": true, "interrupted": false, "subagents_running": false, "executor": "local"}
        },
        {
          "key": "children",
          "facts": {"transcript": "interrupted", "subagents_running": true},
          "row": {"mode": "", "surface": "", "running": false, "interrupted": true, "subagents_running": true, "executor": "local"}
        },
        {
          "key": "building",
          "facts": {"transcript": "interrupted", "under_construction": true},
          "row": null
        },
        {
          "key": "archive",
          "facts": {"transcript": "interrupted", "executor": "remote"},
          "row": {"mode": "", "surface": "", "running": false, "interrupted": true, "subagents_running": false, "executor": "remote"}
        },
        {
          "key": "dm",
          "facts": {"transcript": "interrupted", "mode": "member"},
          "row": {"mode": "member", "surface": "member", "running": false, "interrupted": true, "subagents_running": false, "executor": "local"}
        },
        {
          "key": "autopilot",
          "facts": {"transcript": "interrupted", "mode": "orchestrator"},
          "row": {"mode": "orchestrator", "surface": "orchestrator", "running": false, "interrupted": true, "subagents_running": false, "executor": "local"}
        }
      ],
      "expected": ["cut-short", "start-failed", "reserved", "autopilot"]
    },
    {
      "name": "interrupted sessions that are all out of reach",
      "slots": [
        {
          "key": "busy",
          "facts": {"transcript": "interrupted", "running": true},
          "row": {"mode": "", "surface": "", "running": true, "interrupted": false, "subagents_running": false, "executor": "local"}
        },
        {
          "key": "children",
          "facts": {"transcript": "interrupted", "subagents_running": true},
          "row": {"mode": "", "surface": "", "running": false, "interrupted": true, "subagents_running": true, "executor": "local"}
        },
        {
          "key": "dm",
          "facts": {"transcript": "interrupted", "mode": "member"},
          "row": {"mode": "member", "surface": "member", "running": false, "interrupted": true, "subagents_running": false, "executor": "local"}
        },
        {
          "key": "finished",
          "facts": {"transcript": "finished"},
          "row": {"mode": "", "surface": "", "running": false, "interrupted": false, "subagents_running": false, "executor": "local"}
        }
      ],
      "expected": []
    }
  ]
}
